 605:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h **** /** \brief API to Update the CPU clock counter with a specified value.
 606:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu.h ****  *
